error[E0434]: 'add' is a polymorphic procedure, so it can only be called
 --> test-code/errors/front/E0434-procedure-not-called.mu:7:14
  |
5 |
6 | main :: proc() Int ->
7 |     adder := add
  |              ^^^ not called
8 |     return 0
  |
  = note: a polymorphic procedure is a procedure for each of the types that it is called with, so it
          is no one value
